### ============================
### Dashboard 统计测试
### ============================

### 登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.data.token);
%}


### 经营总览摘要
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 近7天趋势
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard/trend
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 库存预警
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard/warnings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 热销商品 TOP10
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dashboard/top-products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
